From: SKJ Wine <skj-tech@hotmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mmdevapi: Implement IAudioMeterInformation for endpoints.

IMMDevice::Activate failed for IID_IAudioMeterInformation ("Invalid/unknown
iid"), and the interface was only forward declared in endpointvolume.idl.
The peak values are taken from a shared mode stream that is opened on first
use: a loopback stream for render endpoints, a capture stream for capture
endpoints.

Seen with SteelSeries GG: Prism's audio visualizer (audio-sample-lib.dll)
activates the meter of the default render endpoint next to its own loopback
client and never sampled any audio without it.
---
diff --git a/dlls/mmdevapi/audiometer.c b/dlls/mmdevapi/audiometer.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..dca9355
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/mmdevapi/audiometer.c
@@ -0,0 +1,306 @@
